2 CONT *  John O. Evjen, Scandanavian immigrants in New York, 1630-1674 (Baltimore 1972) 105-108.
2 CONT *  Lois M. Feister, ‘Linguistic communication between the Dutch and Indians in New Netherland’, Ethnohistory 20 (1973) 1, 25-38.
2 CONT *  David M. Riker, ‘Surgeon Hans Kierstede of New Amsterdam’, De Halve Maen 57 (1983) 3, 11-13, 24.
