1 NOTE {geni:about_me} There are indications that in this period several Joachims associated with several Hans Kotzes of Kongistein families, very likely for trade and business. One of these men in "Mrs Palmer's book "Beyond the Wall" (1
2 CONC 998) could have started another family branch with the names Joachim and Hans in Konigstein. Marriages and births may have been concealed to avoid embarrassment and inheritance problems for the Head of the Germersleben Kotzes -exp
2 CONC laining uncertainties regarding names and dates in this period. This is noted from Laurie Kotze's Family Tree 2002 
