1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hans von Kotze was born on month day 1508, at birth place, to Hermann von Kotze and Kunigunde von Kotze (born von der Schulenburg). Hermann was born on May 6 1475, in Oschersleben, Gross-Germersleben (Sachsen-Anhal
2 CONC t). Kunigunde was born in 1460. Hans had 2 sisters: Anna von Veltheim (born von Kotze) and one other sibling. Hans married Dorothea von Kotze (born von Alten) on month day 1534, at age 25 at marriage place. Dorothea was born in 15
2 CONC 10, in Groß-Germersleben. They had 11 children: Hans von Kotze, Katharina von Hake (born von Kotze) and 9 other children. Hans passed away on month day 1559, at age 50 at death place.
