1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Erdmuthe Sophie Von Flemming''' was born in 1630 in Bock, Groß Mohrdorf, Mecklenburg-Vorpommern, Germany. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Erdmuthe married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34727955858 Vivigenz Adam Von Eickstedt] in 1652. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34727928141 Friedrich Wilhelm von Eickstedt, II]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1659. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Some have her mother as Dorothea Agnesa Von Flemming with these  parents: https://www.geni.com/people/Hans-von-Flemming/6000000010694283851 and https://www.geni.com/people/Maria-von-Borke-Borcke-adH-Zozenow/6000000017762411805
