1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dotter av Meckleburgska geihemrådet Mattias von Linnestau. (En uråldrig Meckleburgisk adelssläkt). Var änka vid giftemålet 1641 med Johan Printz. 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT The daughter of a Privy Councilor of the city of Mecklenburg , Matthias von Linstow.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Married Johan Björnsson Printz in Stockholm (1641), and accompanied Johan Björnsson Printz to Delaware (1642): https://www.degruyter.com/view/books/9781512814477/9781512814477-002/9781512814477-002.xml
2 CONT
2 CONT Information about second husband colonel Lüdert von Strahlendorff: http://www.30jaehrigerkrieg.de/stralendorff-strahlendorf-strallendorff-ludert-lydert-lutter-von/
2 CONT
2 CONT Second husband colonel Lydert von Strahlendorff and daughter Anna Elisabet von Strahlendorff (von Schrowe) mentioned in a family tree: http://sursill.net/pesped.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Second husband colonel Lydert von Strahlendorff and father Mattias von Linnestau mentioned: https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Printz_nr_304
2 CONT
2 CONT Information about Maria, her three husbands, mother Catharina von Behr and father Mattias von Linstow: http://slaktforskare.se/johan%20printz%20hustru%20maria%20linstow.html
2 CONT
2 CONT A family tree: http://slaktforskare.se/antavlor/carinak/sida0/h_____5x.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Source of daughter (with colonel Lydert von Strahlendorff) Anna Elisabet von Strahlendorff (von Schrowe): Sukukirja (Family Book) von Schrowe
