2 CONT Princess Anna Krystyna Lubomirska (died 1701) was a Polish noble lady.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She was daughter of Grand Marshal and Hetman Jerzy Sebastian Lubomirski h. Szreniawa and Barbara Tarło h. Topór, the daughter of starost of Olsztyn Jan Karol Tarło h. Topór.
