1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 15 NOV 1692
2 ADDR
3 CITY Putzar
3 STAE Meckleburg-Vorpommern
3 CTRY Germany
1 DEAT
2 DATE 27 JAN 1741
2 PLAC Knutstorp
2 ADDR
3 CITY Kågeröd
3 STAE Skåne
3 CTRY Sweden
1 BURI
2 DATE 2 FEB 1741
