0 @N6000000006127255866@ NOTE Hon föddes år 1619 i Beseritz i Mecklenburg och avled i barnsäng den 15 april 1655 i Stockholm. Begraven sedan den 6 maj 1655 i Riddarholmskyrkan. Hennes föräldrar var Rüdiger von Schwerin zu Spantekow (död 1621) och dennes hustru
1 CONC  sedan den 18november 1612 i Clempenow Katharina von Eichstedt (död efter 1638). Barn med Erik: 1. Beata Eriksdotter Stenbock born 5 October 1638 at Klotow, Pommerania, Tyskland died 31 August 1712, married 10 August 1659 at Stock
1 CONC holm baron Axel Carlsson Sparre (born 1620, died 1679).2. Christina Eriksdotter Stenbock born 11 September 1640 at Stockholm, died 27 December 1671 at Stockholm, buried Storkyrkan, Stockholm, married 3 March 1661 at Stockholm baro
1 CONC n Gabriel Kurck (born 1630, died 1712).3. Catharina Eriksdotter Stenbockborn about 1642, Tyskland, died before 9 September 1718, buried Uppsala cathedral4. Gustaf Eriksson Stenbockf 14 May 1644 at Riga, Lettland,  ; d 15 October 1
1 CONC 644 at Riga Lettland,  ; bg 24 October 1644 at Riga cathedral Lettland,  ;  5. Erik Eriksson Stenbockborn 6 October 1645 at Riga, Lettland, died 28 February 1647 at Riga, Lettland, buried 12 March 1647 at Riga cathedral6. Margaret
1 CONC a Eriksdotter Stenbockchristened 10 August 1647 at Stockholm, Stockholms län, Sverige, died 20 September 1651 at Narva, Estland7. Brita Eriksdotter Stenbock born 1648, Estland, died 30 August 1716, buried 18 April 1717 at Tyresö c
1 CONC hurch, married 1680 colonel Hans von Rosen (died 1703).8. Magdalena Erikdotter Stenbockborn 14 October 1649, died 24 January 1727, buried Uppsala cathedral, married 17 December 1667 at Stockholm count Bengt Oxenstierna af Korsholm
1 CONC  och Wasa (born 1623, died 1702).9. Maria Eriksdotter Stenbpckdied 1698, married captain Ture Ribbing (born 1654, died 1697).10. Margareta Eriksdotter Stenbock born 1652 at Narva, Estland, died 2 August 1689 at Örebro, Örebro län,
1 CONC  Sverige; buried Länghem church, married 4 August 1685 at Ulriksdal to colonel Jürgen Johan Wrangel (born 1644, died 1698).11. Hedvig Eleonore Eriksdotter Stenbock born 29 March 1655, Stockholm, Stockholms län, Sverige, died 6 Dec
1 CONC ember 1714, amrried 15 June 1689 at Spantekow count Nikodemus Tessin (born 1654, died 1728).12. Anna Eriksdotter Stenbockdied young13. Fredrik Eriksson Stenbock died 14 February 1699 at Stockholm, Stockholms län, Sverige; buried 4
1 CONC  November 1700 at the church of Strö, Skaraborgs län, Sverige; married 19 July 1681 at Stockholm baroness Helena Creutz (born 18 November 1657 at Falun, died 1 June 1730 atStockholm). 14. Elisabet Eriksdotter Stenbock born 1646, d
1 CONC ied 3 July 1704 at Bjursnäs, Björnlunda, Södermanlands län, Sverige, buried Björklunda church, married 14 September 1670 colonel Carl Hård af Segerstad (died 1704)
0 @N6000000006128168950@ NOTE 1258 kam Burg Spantekow in den Besitz der Familie v. Schwerin (Werner), ob er der Erbauer ist, ist nicht erwiesen.Durch kriegerische Einwirkungen heruntergekommen, erbaut 1558 der Grosshofmeister Ulrich von Schwerin in 9 jähriger 
1 CONC Bauzeit zusammen mit seiner Frau, Anna geb. von Arnim, das Hauptgebäude der Burg auf dem ursprünglichen Platz, (Hügel oberhalb desBurghofes) nach den alten Plänen völlig neu.1634 fällt Spantekow durch den Tod von Vivigenz von Schw
1 CONC erin an Erich Graf von Steenbock, (Schweden) verheiratet mit dessen Schwester Katharina.
